{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00928",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.05,
      "end_seconds": 11.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I want to talk about my contraceptive pill. I think it's giving me side effects."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.21,
      "end_seconds": 22.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Of course. Which pill are you taking, and what are the side effects?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.05,
      "end_seconds": 34.37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "It's called Yasmin, I think. One tablet every day, for a year and a half."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.49,
      "end_seconds": 41.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "And what have you noticed since you started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.61,
      "end_seconds": 51.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Headaches, mostly. And I feel a bit low and bloated before my period."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.03,
      "end_seconds": 60.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Do the headaches have any warning signs, like flashing lights or zigzag lines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.07,
      "end_seconds": 68.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "No, no flashing lights. They're just a dull ache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.36,
      "end_seconds": 73.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Are you taking anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.2,
      "end_seconds": 88.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "A multivitamin, an inhaler for asthma, the blue one, and an antihistamine for hay fever, I can't remember which one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.66,
      "end_seconds": 98.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Do you remember how many puffs of the inhaler, and how often?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.94,
      "end_seconds": 108.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Two puffs when I'm wheezy, maybe once or twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.68,
      "end_seconds": 112.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Any other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.73,
      "end_seconds": 118.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Asthma and hay fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.01,
      "end_seconds": 123.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Do you smoke? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.88,
      "end_seconds": 129.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No. Never. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.41,
      "end_seconds": 140.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.92,
      "text": "And is there a family history of blood clots, or strokes at a young age? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.73,
      "end_seconds": 150.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "My grandmother had a stroke, but she was in her eighties. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.6,
      "end_seconds": 159.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Thank you. That's reassuring. Any migraines with aura yourself? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.64,
      "end_seconds": 164.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "No. Just dull headaches. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.03,
      "end_seconds": 176.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "I'd like to take a look at what's going on. Has your blood pressure been checked recently? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.92,
      "end_seconds": 187.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "At the pharmacy a few months ago, and they said it was normal. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.56,
      "end_seconds": 195.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "I'd like to check it today. The pill can raise it a little."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.8,
      "end_seconds": 212.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.99,
      "end_seconds": 219.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Blood pressure is 118 over 74, which is perfectly fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.86,
      "end_seconds": 227.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "That's good. So what do you think about the headaches? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.55,
      "end_seconds": 241.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "Headaches and mood changes are common with hormonal pills, and they often settle. If they don't, we can try another brand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.7,
      "end_seconds": 246.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What's the alternative? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.1,
      "end_seconds": 260.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.68,
      "text": "A pill with a different hormone, or a different type of contraception, like an implant or a coil. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.55,
      "end_seconds": 269.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "I'd like to try a different pill first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.74,
      "end_seconds": 281.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "Let's do that. I'll switch you to a different brand, and you can see how you get on for three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.03,
      "end_seconds": 287.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Great. Thank you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.71,
      "end_seconds": 301.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "Come back and see me in three months, and let me know sooner if the headaches get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.95,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Will do. ~"
    }
  ]
}
